Hi both,

This PR fixes a link wrapping issue and it has been tested in Chrome, FF, Safari, Edge, and IE11. Would it be possible to merge this PR if you are happy? Thank you 👍 

@gtvj I tried removing the `inline-block` property on links (and just using `inline`) but this broke focus and hover styles on other links. I had a call with Ash to discuss this and we added the `word-wrap` property as this seemed to fix the issue without introducing any breaking changes.

Prevent other input, not related to google type value, to be cleared when a place is selected in autocomplete.

Enhancement:
- Allow passing plugin settings;
- Allow to clear Autocomplete field when a place is select. Default to true.
- Allow to run callback function when place is select. Callback receive the autocomplete.

Example:

```
$ga = $form->addControl('map_search', [AddressLookup::class, ['settings' => [
    'autoClear' => false,
    'callback' => new JsFunction(['ac'], [new JsExpression('console.log(ac.getPlace())')])
    ]
]]);
```

