Even though `GLX_CONTEXT_FORWARD_COMPATIBLE_BIT_ARB` works, seems to be only for luck as it is the same value as `GLX_CONTEXT_COMPATIBILITY_PROFILE_BIT_ARB`.

glfw has the following code:
